The function you are looking for is ? subset
df <- subset(df, day %in% c('Sat', 'Sun'), )

or

df <- df[df$day %in% c('Sat', 'Sun'), ]

If your dataset is huge, checkout this package called 'data.table'. data.table intro <http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/data.table/vignettes/datatable-intro.pdf>
Instead of using vector scan, data.table utilize binary search.

